  "description": "Elevate your typography with ultimate versatility, refined elegance, and modern character using Gilferos! This comprehensive sans-serif family offers a massive suite of 72 styles—ranging from condensed to expanded widths, plus regular and italic variants. Featuring bold high-contrast strokes, graceful calligraphic curves, and unique fluid terminals, it seamlessly bridges the gap between clean functional sans-serifs and expressive display type.\nIdeal for high-end editorial layouts, corporate branding, modern logo design, luxury packaging, web banners, magazine titles, poster headlines, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG projects!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Elevate your typography with ultimate versatility, refined elegance, and modern character using Gilferos! This comprehensive sans-serif family offers a massive suite of 72 styles—ranging from condensed to expanded widths, plus regular and italic variants. Featuring bold high-contrast strokes, graceful calligraphic curves, and unique fluid terminals, it seamlessly bridges the gap between clean functional sans-serifs and expressive display type.</p>\n<p>Ideal for high-end editorial layouts, corporate branding, modern logo design, luxury packaging, web banners, magazine titles, poster headlines, and custom Cricut or Silhouette craft SVG projects!</p>",
